      "comment": "Zeitlind: Raumhilda",
      "content": "Zeitlind's older sister, outgoing, who read aloud to her and wrote letters from the Windrest Peak sanatorium. After a broken engagement she was admitted there and vanished, leaving a fake grave that reads \"One lifetime doesn't count.\" She had once been sent to the Temple of Space, where she gave up her memories to create the Path to the Heavens and faced Melanta; no one knows what they said.",
